    <task id="Id_5d3d972a-2cd9-4dc2-b034-6bc290d57696" name="5.7.2 a) Request submission">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Revis&amp;atilde;o bem-sucedida&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. A contratada deve instruir cada equipe de tarefas para submeter suas infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es para aceita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o pela contratante no ambiente comum de dados (CDE) do projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_7d0c7f3e-10de-47c7-bcaf-7353c62ee111</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_ee784694-990d-4afb-8f5e-dc82af00fe90</outgoing>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_1f41914d-04fd-48a1-a0d7-943f60158b3f" name="5.7.2 b) Verification rejected">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Revis&amp;atilde;o n&amp;atilde;o for bem-sucedida&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. a contratada deve rejeitar o modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e instruir as equipes de tarefas para alterar a informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e ressubmet&amp;ecirc;-lo para autoriza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da contratada.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
