    <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Process of developing adaptations of the standard project to local conditions and delivery of the project, considering the synergy between the various activities of the municipalities and Law No. 14,133/2021 - Law on Public Procurement and Administrative Contracts, with Item 5.6 - Collaborative production of information and Item 5.7 - Delivery of the ISO 19650-2 information model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
